     "texto": [
      "日 (sun) + 本 (origin) = **日本**, «the origin of the sun»: Japan.",
      "The days of the week end in 日, and the months end in 月: **日曜日** (Sunday), **七月** (July).",
      "Prices are written with 円: **五百円** (500 yen)."
